About METEOR
------------

Your space shuttle is in a meteor field, try to avoid collisions. You
can move using 4 definable keys (up, down, left and right). There are
three levels of difficulty and a High Score table for each level.

Installation
------------

- Copy the file Meteor.opa to your \APP\ directory
- Copy the file Meteor.pic to your \OPD\ directory
- If you want to use the sound option,
  copy the file explode.wve to your \WVE\ directory.

Use psion-I to install METEOR as usual.

Meteor will also create the files meteor.def and meteor.hsc in the
\OPD\ directory of the internal disk.

