You must register if you continue to use this program after 30 days.

The shareware version of METEOR is fully functioning, with the only
nuisance of "nag" screens. Registered users will receive a personal
code allowing to disable these nag screens.

IF YOU HAVE AN E-MAIL ADDRESS, please send it to me and I will send
your code by email.

IF YOU DON'T HAVE AN E-MAIL ADDRESS, DON'T FORGET to send me a self
addressed envelope, so I can mail your registration code.

When you receive your code, you just have to enter it (press Psion-G
during a game). This will create a file Meteor.reg in the M:\OPD\
directory, and disable all nag screens.

